#: docking/core/tips.py:57
msgid "Open the dock menu from anywhere"
msgstr "Oscail an roghchlár duga ó áit ar bith"

#: docking/core/tips.py:59
msgid ""
"Hold Ctrl and right-click anywhere on the shelf to open the dock menu. This "
"is the quickest path to Preferences, Applets, Diagnostics, and Quit when "
"there is no empty space near the icons."
msgstr ""
"Coinnigh Ctrl agus deaschliceáil áit ar bith ar an tseilf chun an roghchlár "
"duga a oscailt. Is é seo an cosán is tapúla chun Roghanna, Feidhmchláiríní, "
"Diagnóisic, agus Scoir nuair nach bhfuil aon spás folamh in aice leis na "
"deilbhíní."

#: docking/core/tips.py:67
msgid "Start with Preferences"
msgstr "Tosaigh le Roghanna"

#: docking/core/tips.py:69
msgid ""
"Use Preferences to adjust position, monitor behavior, icon size, zoom, "
"hiding, themes, previews, tooltips, and click actions. It is the best first "
"stop when the dock does not feel quite right."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid Roghanna chun suíomh a choigeartú, monatóireacht a dhéanamh ar iompar, "
"méid deilbhíní, súmáil isteach, dul i bhfolach, téamaí, réamhamhairc, "
"leideanna uirlisí, agus gníomhartha cliceáil. Is é an chéad stad is fearr "
"nuair nach mbraitheann an duga ceart go leor."

#: docking/core/tips.py:76
msgid "Add applets from the dock menu"
msgstr "Cuir feidhmchláiríní ón roghchlár duga"

#: docking/core/tips.py:78
msgid ""
"Right-click the shelf background and choose Add Applet to add launchers, "
"system status, media controls, productivity helpers, and small utility tools "
"directly to the dock."
msgstr ""
"Deaschliceáil ar chúlra na seilfe agus roghnaigh Cuir Feidhmchláirín leis "
"chun lainseálaithe, stádas córais, rialuithe meán, cúntóirí táirgiúlachta, "
"agus uirlisí beaga fóntais a chur leis go díreach chuig an duga."

#: docking/core/tips.py:85
msgid "Use separators for organization"
msgstr "Úsáid deighilteoirí don eagraíocht"

#: docking/core/tips.py:87
msgid ""
"Right-click where a divider should go and choose Add Separator. Separators "
"make it easier to keep pinned apps, folders, and applets in clear groups."
msgstr ""
"Cliceáil ar dheis ar an áit ar cheart do roinnteoir dul agus roghnaigh Add "
"Deighilteoir. Déanann deighilteoirí é níos éasca aipeanna, fillteáin agus "
"feidhmchláiríní pinned a choinneáil i ngrúpaí soiléire."

#: docking/core/tips.py:94
msgid "Pin running apps"
msgstr "Pin apps reatha"

#: docking/core/tips.py:96
msgid ""
"Right-click a running app and choose Keep in Dock. The launcher will stay "
"available after the app closes, so you can start it again with one click."
msgstr ""
"Deaschliceáil ar aip reatha agus roghnaigh Coinnigh sa Duga. Fanfaidh an "
"tosaitheoir ar fáil tar éis don aip a bheith dúnta, ionas gur féidir leat é "
"a thosú arís le cliceáil amháin."

#: docking/core/tips.py:103
msgid "Remove pinned items quickly"
msgstr "Bain míreanna pinn go tapa"

#: docking/core/tips.py:105
msgid ""
"Right-click a pinned item and choose Remove from Dock, or drag unlocked "
"items off the dock. Removing a launcher does not uninstall the application "
"or delete your files."
msgstr ""
"Deaschliceáil ar mhír phionnáilte agus roghnaigh Bain as an Duga, nó "
"tarraing míreanna neamhghlasáilte den duga. Má bhaintear tosaitheoir, ní "
"dhíshuiteáiltear an feidhmchlár ná ní scriosfar do chomhaid."

#: docking/core/tips.py:112
msgid "Drop items onto the dock"
msgstr "Buail míreanna isteach sa duga"

#: docking/core/tips.py:114
msgid ""
"Drag applications, .desktop files, files, folders, and AppImages onto "
"Docking to pin them. Dropped folders become folder stacks, and dropped "
"AppImages can get their own launcher."
msgstr ""
"Tarraing feidhmchláir, comhaid deisce, comhaid, fillteáin, agus AppImages ar "
"Á Chur chun iad a phionnáil. Déantar fillteáin titithe ina gcruacha "
"fillteán, agus is féidir le AppImages a thit amach a dtosaitheoir féin a "
"fháil."

#: docking/core/tips.py:121
msgid "Open files with dock apps"
msgstr "Oscail comhaid le apps duga"

#: docking/core/tips.py:123
msgid ""
"Drag a file onto an application icon to open it with that app. This is "
"useful when the file manager would otherwise choose the wrong default "
"application."
msgstr ""
"Tarraing comhad ar dheilbhín feidhmchláir chun é a oscailt leis an aip sin. "
"Tá sé seo úsáideach nuair a roghnaíonn an bainisteoir comhad an feidhmchlár "
"réamhshocraithe mícheart."

#: docking/core/tips.py:130
msgid "Use folder stacks"
msgstr "Úsáid cruacha fillteán"

#: docking/core/tips.py:132
msgid ""
"Pin a folder and click it from the dock to browse its contents without "
"opening a file manager first. It works well for common places like "
"Downloads, Projects, and screenshots."
msgstr ""
"Pin fillteán agus cliceáil é ón duga chun a bhfuil ann a bhrabhsáil gan "
"bainisteoir comhad a oscailt ar dtús. Oibríonn sé go maith le haghaidh "
"áiteanna coitianta ar nós Íoslódálacha, Tionscadail, agus screenshots."

#: docking/core/tips.py:139
msgid "Tune folder stack behavior"
msgstr "Tune iompar chairn fillteán"

#: docking/core/tips.py:141
msgid ""
"Right-click a pinned folder to sort contents, show hidden files, or "
"customize its icon. These options let each stack behave like the folder it "
"represents."
msgstr ""
"Deaschliceáil ar fhillteán pinned chun ábhar a shórtáil, comhaid fholaithe a "
"thaispeáint, nó a dheilbhín a shaincheapadh. Ligeann na roghanna seo do gach "
"stack iad féin a iompar mar an fillteán a léiríonn sé."

#: docking/core/tips.py:148
msgid "Keep mounted devices within reach"
msgstr "Coinnigh na gléasanna feistithe in aice láimhe"

#: docking/core/tips.py:150
msgid ""
"Add the Devices applet to browse every mounted device in a live stack. "
"Mounts appear and disappear automatically, and Preferences -> Behavior "
"controls whether stacks open on hover or click."
msgstr "Cuir feidhmchláirín Gléasanna leis chun gach gléas feistithe a "
"bhrabhsáil i gcarn beo. Tagann feistithe chun solais agus imíonn siad go "
"huathoibríoch, agus rialaíonn Sainroghanna -> Iompar cé acu a osclaítear "
"carnáin ar hover nó ar chliceáil."

#: docking/core/tips.py:158
msgid "Follow news sources by country"
msgstr "Lean foinsí nuachta de réir tíre"

#: docking/core/tips.py:160
msgid ""
"Add the News applet, choose a country, and select a publication or edition. "
"Scroll through its latest headlines, or add more sources and switch between "
"them from the applet menu."
msgstr "Cuir feidhmchláirín Nuachta leis, roghnaigh tír, agus roghnaigh "
"foilseachán nó eagrán. Scrollaigh trí na ceannlínte is déanaí, nó cuir "
"tuilleadh foinsí leis agus aistrigh eatarthu ó roghchlár an fheidhmchláirín."

#: docking/core/tips.py:167
msgid "Customize pinned icons"
msgstr "Saincheap deilbhíní pinn"

#: docking/core/tips.py:169
msgid ""
"Right-click a pinned app, file, or folder and use Icon -> Choose From File. "
"Custom icons are stored in Docking's config, so the original desktop file or "
"file on disk is left untouched."
msgstr ""
"Deaschliceáil ar aip, comhad, nó fillteán pinned agus úsáid Icon -> "
"Roghnaigh Ó Chomhad. Stóráiltear deilbhíní saincheaptha i gcumraíocht "
"Docking, mar sin fágtar an comhad deisce bunaidh nó an comhad ar diosca gan "
"teagmháil."

#: docking/core/tips.py:176
msgid "Use the Applications applet search"
msgstr "Úsáid an cuardach feidhmchláirín Feidhmchláir"

#: docking/core/tips.py:178
msgid ""
"Add the Applications applet, open it, and type to filter installed apps. It "
"gives you a compact launcher menu without leaving the dock."
msgstr ""
"Cuir feidhmchláirín Feidhmchláir leis, oscail é, agus clóscríobh chun "
"aipeanna suiteáilte a scagadh. Tugann sé roghchlár tosaitheoir dlúth duit "
"gan an duga a fhágáil."

#: docking/core/tips.py:185
msgid "Drag apps straight to the dock"
msgstr "Tarraing aipeanna go díreach chun an duga"

#: docking/core/tips.py:187
msgid ""
"Open the Applications applet and drag any application from its menu onto the "
"shelf. Drop it where you want its launcher to stay in the dock."
msgstr "Oscail feidhmchláirín Feidhmchlár agus tarraing aon fheidhmchlár óna "
"roghchlár ar an tseilf. Scaoil é san áit ar mian leat go bhfanfadh a "
"thosaitheoir sa duga."

#: docking/core/tips.py:194
msgid "Keep WhatsApp in the dock"
msgstr "Coinnigh WhatsApp sa duga"

#: docking/core/tips.py:196
msgid ""
"Add the WhatsApp applet for a persistent WhatsApp Web window, desktop "
"notifications, and an unread-message badge. Closing the window hides it "
"without signing out."
msgstr "Cuir feidhmchláirín WhatsApp leis chun fuinneog mharthanach WhatsApp "
"Web, fógraí deisce, agus suaitheantas teachtaireachtaí neamhléite a fháil. "
"Nuair a dhúntar an fhuinneog folaítear í gan síniú amach."

#: docking/core/tips.py:203
msgid "Use Run Application like Alt+F2"
msgstr "Úsáid Feidhmchlár Rith mar Alt+F2"

#: docking/core/tips.py:205
msgid ""
"Add Run Application to launch commands, apps, and terminal commands from the "
"dock. As you type, matching applications are shown so you can launch by name "
"or run a standalone command."
msgstr ""
"Cuir Feidhmchlár Rith leis chun orduithe, aipeanna agus orduithe teirminéil "
"a sheoladh ón duga. Agus tú ag clóscríobh, taispeántar feidhmchláir "
"mheaitseála ionas gur féidir leat ordú neamhspleách a sheoladh de réir ainm "
"nó a rith."

#: docking/core/tips.py:212
msgid "Use window previews"
msgstr "Úsáid réamhamhairc fuinneoige"

#: docking/core/tips.py:214
msgid ""
"Hover running apps to inspect open windows before switching. Previews help "
"when one application has several windows open."
msgstr ""
"Déan aipeanna atá á rith chun fuinneoga oscailte a iniúchadh roimh athrú. "
"Cuidíonn réamhamhairc nuair a bhíonn roinnt fuinneoga oscailte ag "
"feidhmchlár amháin."

#: docking/core/tips.py:220
msgid "Choose your click behavior"
msgstr "Roghnaigh do iompraíocht cliceáil"

#: docking/core/tips.py:222
msgid ""
"Preferences -> Behavior lets left click toggle, cycle, or focus the most "
"recent window. Pick the behavior that matches how you switch between running "
"applications."
msgstr ""
"Roghanna -> Ligeann iompar cliceáil ar chlé scoránaigh, timthriall, nó "
"dírigh an fhuinneog is déanaí. Roghnaigh an t-iompar a mheaitseálann an "
"chaoi a n-aistríonn tú idir feidhmchláir reatha."

#: docking/core/tips.py:229
msgid "Ctrl-click opens a new window"
msgstr "Osclaíonn Ctrl-cliceáil fuinneog nua"

#: docking/core/tips.py:231
msgid ""
"Hold Ctrl while clicking an app icon to launch another window. This works "
"even when the app is already running and a normal click would focus it."
msgstr ""
"Coinnigh Ctrl agus cliceáil ar dheilbhín app chun fuinneog eile a sheoladh. "
"Oibríonn sé seo fiú nuair a bhíonn an app ag rith cheana féin agus go "
"ndíreodh gnáthchliceáil air."

#: docking/core/tips.py:238
msgid "Use Clock as a calendar"
msgstr "Úsáid an Clog mar fhéilire"

#: docking/core/tips.py:240
msgid ""
"Left-click the Clock applet to open the same calendar popup as the Calendar "
"applet. Use Clock when you want the time and calendar in one dock item."
msgstr "Cliceáil ar chlé ar fheidhmchláirín an Chloig chun an phreabfhuinneog "
"féilire chéanna a oscailt agus a osclaíonn feidhmchláirín Féilire. Úsáid an "
"Clog nuair is mian leat an t-am agus an féilire a bheith in aon mhír duga "
"amháin."

#: docking/core/tips.py:247
msgid "Use app right-click menus"
msgstr "Bain úsáid as roghchláir deaschliceáil app"

#: docking/core/tips.py:249
msgid ""
"Right-click apps for desktop actions, open windows, recent documents, "
"pinning, and close actions. Many apps expose useful shortcuts there, such as "
"opening a private window or composing a new message."
msgstr ""
"Aipeanna cliceáil ar dheis le haghaidh gníomhartha deisce, fuinneoga a "
"oscailt, doiciméid le déanaí, feannadh, agus gníomhartha dúnta. Nochtann go "
"leor apps aicearraí úsáideacha ann, mar fhuinneog phríobháideach a oscailt "
"nó teachtaireacht nua a chumadh."

#: docking/core/tips.py:257
msgid "Use Recent Files"
msgstr "Úsáid Comhaid Déanaí"

#: docking/core/tips.py:259
msgid ""
"Add the Recent Files applet to jump back into documents you used recently. "
"It is a faster path when you remember the file, not the folder."
msgstr ""
"Cuir feidhmchláirín Comhaid Déanaí leis chun léim isteach arís i ndoiciméid "
"a d’úsáid tú le déanaí. Is cosán níos tapúla é nuair a chuimhníonn tú ar an "
"gcomhad, ní ar an bhfillteán."

#: docking/core/tips.py:266
msgid "Use System Tray when needed"
msgstr "Úsáid Tráidire Córais nuair is gá"

#: docking/core/tips.py:268
msgid ""
"Add System Tray for tray/status apps and use its menu to manage tray "
"ownership when supported. This helps with legacy apps that still rely on a "
"classic notification area."
msgstr ""
"Cuir Tráidire Córais leis le haghaidh aipeanna tráidire/stádais agus úsáid a "
"roghchlár chun úinéireacht tráidire a bhainistiú nuair a thacaítear leis. "
"Cuidíonn sé seo le apps oidhreachta atá fós ag brath ar limistéar fógra "
"clasaiceach."

#: docking/core/tips.py:275
msgid "Use Diagnostics for support"
msgstr "Bain úsáid as Diagnóisic le haghaidh tacaíochta"

#: docking/core/tips.py:277
msgid ""
"Open Diagnostics before filing an issue to copy backend, session, and "
"feature details. Including that report makes it much easier to understand "
"compositor, monitor, and environment-specific problems."
msgstr ""
"Oscail Diagnóisic roimh shaincheist a chomhdú chun inneall, seisiún agus "
"sonraí gné a chóipeáil. Má chuirtear an tuarascáil sin san áireamh, is fusa "
"i bhfad fadhbanna a bhaineann le cumadóirí, monatóireacht agus timpeallacht "
"a thuiscint."

